# Jekyll Blog Rules (Chirpy Theme)

## Project Overview
This is a Jekyll-based personal blog using the **Chirpy** theme. It focuses on technical writing, algorithms, AWS, and English learning.

## File Naming Convention
- Blog posts MUST follow the naming pattern: `YYYY-MM-DD-TITLE.md`
- Place all posts in the `_posts/` directory
- File extension must be `.md` or `.markdown`
- Example: `2024-11-19-my-awesome-post.md`

## Front Matter Structure

### Required Fields
```yaml
---
title: Post Title Here
author: thanhnv1808
date: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS +0700
categories: [Top Category, Sub Category]
tags: [tag1, tag2]
description: Short summary of the post
---
```

### Front Matter Rules
1. **title**: Clear, descriptive post title.
2. **author**: Use `thanhnv1808` as the default author.
3. **date**: Must include timezone offset. Use `+0700` as the default.
4. **categories**: Array with UP TO 2 elements `[TOP_CATEGORY, SUB_CATEGORY]`.
5. **tags**: Array with any number of elements, MUST be lowercase.
6. **layout**: NOT needed (defaults to 'post').
7. **comments**: Set to `true` to enable comments.

### Optional Front Matter Fields
```yaml
pin: true                           # Pin to top of home page
toc: false                          # Disable table of contents
math: true                          # Enable MathJax for equations
mermaid: true                       # Enable Mermaid diagrams
media_subpath: /path/to/media/      # Media resource path prefix
image:                              # Preview image (1200x630, ratio 1.91:1)
  path: /path/to/image
  alt: image alternative text
```

## Content Formatting

### Filepath Highlighting
```markdown
`/path/to/file.ext`{: .filepath}
```

### Prompts (Alerts)
```markdown
> Tip content here
{: .prompt-tip }

> Info content here
{: .prompt-info }

> Warning content here
{: .prompt-warning }

> Danger content here
{: .prompt-danger }
```

### Code Blocks

**With filename:**
```markdown
```language
code here
```
{: file="path/to/file" }
```

**Without line numbers:**
```markdown
```language
code here
```
{: .nolineno }
```

### Images

**Basic with caption:**
```markdown
![Image description](/path/to/image)
_Image Caption_
```

**With size (recommended):**
```markdown
![Image description](/path/to/image){: w="700" h="400" }
```

**Theme-specific:**
- `{: .light }` - Light mode only
- `{: .dark }` - Dark mode only
- `{: .shadow }` - Add shadow effect

### Mathematics (MathJax)
Enable with `math: true` in front matter.
- Block: `$$ ... $$`
- Inline: `$$ ... $$`
- In lists: `\$$ ... $$`

### Mermaid Diagrams
Enable with `mermaid: true` in front matter.
```mermaid
graph TD
  A --> B
```

## Media Assets
- Store post-specific images in `assets/img/YYYYMMDD/` directory.
- Use local paths for images whenever possible.

## Best Practices
1. **Always include timezone** in date field (`+0700`).
2. **Keep tags lowercase**.
3. **Limit categories to 2**.
4. **Add image dimensions** (`w` and `h`) to prevent layout shift.
5. **Use prompts** for tips and warnings.
6. **Avoid Jekyll {% highlight %}** tags; use standard markdown code blocks.
